Train like a boxer-superstar and improve your combat skills with the Real Boxing app!

Real Boxing allows you to:
 - Check the strength of your punch;
 - Keep track of your progress;
 - Become a better boxer or MMA fighter;
 - Compete with friends and see who hits harder.

Use your Apple Watch to hear the sound of your punch and check the force of your hit. You can just as easily measure the strength of your punch with your mobile phone!

Real Boxing will help you train like a pro:
 - Feel the rush of a real match;
 - Track your progress and watch your punching skills improve with every training session;
 - Impress your friends and competitors with your powerful punch.

With Real Boxing, you will always be respected among your peers, making every boxing experience a thrilling adventure.

